<description>&lt;p&gt;Thai security forces seized millions of meth pills after an armed clash with border troops, and authorities issued arrest warrants for high-profile suspects in cross-border money laundering and a stock-market scandal. The government proposed a 15‑day visa-free entry for travelers from three countries and is introducing digital border passes at the Mae Sai crossing as part of the BLOOM digital money settlement initiative. Joint maritime patrols and a newly completed phase of a border fence in Chanthaburi aim to curb crime and improve connectivity with Malaysia. 35 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxQeHZreU5lalJ1N2xmX0dxXzE0Q0tITmxzWDZqUV9SdWJybXNHNEU3RUw2bnJUS2luRkFxMjV3UUN0YXR2UVNBMkVSWlB0TTR5Nlk3ZzBSZ1ozNHp0WEZsUHpmTzhEZ3hoVnFveS05VkNSeVlXM2lQRVdpdXZjWFRqUnRyOEJ2bTZPaHkzQm5RbGJQUWhWYkw5dzNXOHp0Ql9sMXZORGNnelM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxOeHRvdGpYeHlabERlWVNvN3RZLVNnQlAtSU1Fb1YxREZEd0RlRDJXUHkxMkloNVNMX284WEVaY3k4ZmVPMkxpRmhhUGFCY0pwVG40LVNDQ1NRZ0ZNMFNWc1dGakI1eFdxSGhyTVdfT1pjeWFZVXhnZGNDVkEzSWpEdmh0dzF6M3p1a1d4TkNFaFp3cTl6NVF4T05qdldqV3V5cnN2Z05kRHVQdGtTSTB5NWxQZm0wU1ExWnhPckpB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Vietnam.vn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYkFVX3lxTFA2c1FBRy1hRDNrTmxNU0R0eUpvaFdra0RKbjU1MWsyMnlvWUMyMkxUNnBXcFRMTWNZbjZTdkpPcWpjWGk2UTZFQnVtY2VuaGhaTWh5b2IyY1FiVmhPSzF3c0VB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nation Thailand&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxPNV9Zakx5ZF8yc0tvZUJjdHRnT3lKQkVYbnp4b0V0ZF9qMk4tZmtldVU3NEpySWFNam8yYjNXeWo5aFM4VHc0emd2QjhoWl9aUzJ4OUtWOHJGZ0k4SHhSYVNGdFRWRFUyUmJZQUllRkZ1dWd2VFExbFdvbEdHZWlRSnJPX0MyQnhPVTc1LTNFRzJqYjhLNFJQMkdScTY3aWhYQlJROXMwMkpQc0U?oc=5&qu